{
  "_id": "8Z0BEiIAx",
  "name": "HEVC QSV: H.264 above 10 Mbps",
  "description": "2026-10-07. Only H.264 with overall bitrate > 10 Mbps (older Rokus lack HEVC; typical ~8 Mbps web releases stay H.264 for direct play). hevc_qsv global_quality 18 (user-approved after q25/q22/q20/q18 tests on Homeland S07E02) preset slow, all audio/subtitle streams copied. Output must match duration within 0.5% (else fail, original kept) and be 10-85% of the original size: >85% = not worth it, flow ends, original kept; <10% = suspicious, fail. Then replace original.",
  "tags": "",
